        <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:200;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">30-40</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.7rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;">Days Production</div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2rem;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:200;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Fit</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.7rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;">Testing</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Capabilities Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Our Capabilities</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Plus Size Manufacturing Capabilities</h2>
    </div>
    
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;">
      Our plus size manufacturing covers the full production cycle from pattern grading to finished garment. We use specialized grading rules for plus sizes, conduct fit testing, and ensure proportional fit across all sizes.
    </p>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:1rem;">
      Production capacity: 40,000-60,000 plus size pieces per month across multiple production lines. We handle basic plus size tops for wholesale, premium plus size dresses for boutique brands, and inclusive collections for fashion brands.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Grading Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Sizing</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Plus Size Grading (1X-5X)</h2>
    </div>
    
    <ul style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;max-width:800px;">
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
        <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
        Specialized grading rules for plus size proportions
      </li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
        <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
        Proportional adjustments for bust, waist, and hip
